{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-c5268d67-ce53-42d8-927f-df7b46a45be0","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"chatcmpl-tool-9c70b400c7a0f6d9","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/private/var/folders/h5/l8qslbp55w5621qf9ngsh5jc0000gn/T/epic-RHAISTRAT-9015-le72t40j/artifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9015-E003.md","content":"# Open run comparison from the Model Registry UI\n\n## Description\n\nThis epic delivers the Dashboard-side surfacing of model-version run lineage: from the Model Registry UI in the Dashboard, a user can see the run that produced a registered model version and open the run comparison view starting from that run. This connects the registry catalog to the comparison capability so promotion decisions can be made without leaving the platform.\n\n## Scope\n\n- Surface the producing-run linkage on registered model version views in the Dashboard's Model Registry UI.\n- Add an entry point from a registered model version to the run comparison view (e.g., open a comparison seeded with the producing run so another run can be selected to compare against).\n- Build against the model-version-to-run linkage exposed by the Model Registry REST API and extend the existing run comparison view; do not build a second comparison surface.\n- Incidental UI text updates that fall out of these changes are included here; standalone documentation is handled separately.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- Given a registered model version that has a producing-run link, when the user views it in the Model Registry UI, then the producing run is visible and identifiable.\n- Given a registered model version with a producing-run link, when the user opens a comparison from it, then the run comparison view opens with the producing run selected so a second run can be chosen for comparison.\n- Given a registered model version without a producing-run link (legacy registrations), when viewed, then the comparison entry point degrades gracefully without