{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-bf0ea6e96c586ec4","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9015-E001\n3\ttitle: Run comparison view in the Dashboard (side-by-side and diff)\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9015\n5\tcomponent: Dashboard\n6\tteam: RHOAI Dashboard\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P0\n9\tdependencies: []\n10\tai_signals:\n11\t  change_specificity: 0\n12\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n13\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n14\t  existing_foundation: 1\n15\t  open_questions: 1\n16\t  external_dependency: 1\n17\t  human_process_gates: 1\n18\t  repo_access: 1\n19\t  architecture_claims: 1\n20\timplementation_type: null\n21\tinvestigation_signals: null\n22\tai_implementability: High\n23\tai_implementability_score: 7\n24\tjira_key: null\n25\tbranch: null\n26\tgated_by: null\n27\tgate_failure_impact: null\n28\t---\n29\t# Run comparison view in the Dashboard (side-by-side and diff)\n30\t\n31\t## Description\n32\t\n33\tThis epic delivers the core run comparison capability in the Dashboard: users can select two or more training/pipeline runs and view their parameters and metrics side by side, and, for two selected runs, a diff presentation that highlights which parameters and metrics changed between them. This replaces the current workflow where comparison happens only in exported spreadsheets because parameters and metrics live in per-run pages.\n34\t\n35\t## Scope\n36\t\n37\t- Add multi-run selection from the existing runs list in the Dashboard (two or more runs).\n38\t- Render a comparison view showing parameters and metrics of the selected runs side by side.\n39\t- Provide a diff presentation mode of the same comparison surface that highlights which parameters and metrics differ between two selected runs (the diff is a mode of the comparison view over the same run data, not a separate surface).\n40\t- Read run parameters and metrics through the existing run data surfaces the Dashboard already uses for per-run pages; no new backend data plane is introduced by this epic.\n41\t- Validation that the comparison view works against Data Science Pipelines runs (parameters and metrics for multiple runs retrievable and rendered correctly), recorded as an acceptance criterion on this epic's deliverable.\n42\t- Incidental UI text and in-product reference updates that fall out of the new views are included here; standalone documentation is handled separately.\n43\t\n44\t## Acceptance Criteria\n45\t\n46\t- Given a list of runs, when the user selects two or more runs, then a comparison view opens showing each run's parameters and metrics side by side.\n47\t- Given two selected runs in the comparison view, when the user switches to the diff presentation, then the parameters and metrics that differ between the two runs are highlighted, and unchanged values are distinguishable from changed ones.\n48\t- Given runs produced by Data Science Pipelines, when compared, then their parameters and metrics are retrieved via the existing pipeline run surfaces and rendered completely in both presentation modes (validates the Data Science Pipelines component keeps working with this feature).\n49\t- The comparison view is reachable from the runs list in the Dashboard without leaving the platform (no spreadsheet export required for comparison).\n50\t\n51\t## HLR Traceability\n52\t\n53\t- HLR-1 (P0): Users can select two or more runs and view their parameters and metrics side by side in the Dashboard — fully covered by this epic.\n54\t- HLR-3 (P1): Run \"diff\" view highlighting which parameters and metrics changed between two selected runs — covered by this epic. Consolidated with HLR-1: both describe the same comparison surface over the same run data for the same component and team (the strategy notes wording overlap kept from two customer councils); the diff is a presentation mode of the side-by-side view, so splitting would build the same UI surface twice. Bundled at the higher priority (P0).\n55\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9c5fb85cbf9aabae","agent_id":"a96235dc186d39004","session_id":"000d175c-8257-4923-ab3f-0ba108064e97","uuid":"fd7377f9-2c74-4d5a-98f2-ba79d0d454d2","timestamp":"2026-10-25T18:52:43.586Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-bf0ea6e96c586ec4","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9015 decomposition"}
