{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-bbe51dceea5345cb","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9015-E004\n3\ttitle: Validate multi-run parameter/metric retrieval for Data Science Pipelines\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9015\n5\tcomponent: Data Science Pipelines\n6\tteam: RHOAI Pipelines\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P1\n9\tdependencies: []\n10\tai_signals:\n11\t  change_specificity: 1\n12\t  pattern_precedent: 0\n13\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n14\t  existing_foundation: 1\n15\t  open_questions: 1\n16\t  external_dependency: 1\n17\t  human_process_gates: 1\n18\t  repo_access: 1\n19\t  architecture_claims: 1\n20\timplementation_type: null\n21\tinvestigation_signals: null\n22\tai_implementability: High\n23\tai_implementability_score: 7\n24\tjira_key: null\n25\tbranch: null\n26\tgated_by: null\n27\tgate_failure_impact: null\n28\t---\n29\t# Validate multi-run parameter/metric retrieval for Data Science Pipelines\n30\t\n31\t## Description\n32\t\n33\tThis epic delivers a validation of the Data Science Pipelines component as it supports the new run comparison capability: confirm that parameters and metrics for multiple pipeline runs can be retrieved through the existing pipeline run surfaces in the way the Dashboard comparison view consumes them, and report any gaps. Data Science Pipelines requires no code changes for the comparison feature per the strategy; this epic is the validation work performed by the component's owning team because a different team owns the component than the one building the comparison UI.\n34\t\n35\t## Scope\n36\t\n37\t- Exercise retrieval of parameters and metrics for multiple runs (including runs from different experiments where applicable within a project) through the existing run data surfaces the Dashboard uses.\n38\t- Confirm the retrieved data is complete and correctly attributed per run for side-by-side and diff presentation (parameters and metric values match what the per-run pages show).\n39\t- Produce a findings report: confirmed behaviors, and any gaps or limitations discovered (with severity), handed to the Dashboard team.\n40\t- If a gap is found that would require a Data Science Pipelines code change, record it as a finding for follow-up planning; implementing such a change is out of scope for this epic.\n41\t\n42\t## Acceptance Criteria\n43\t\n44\t- A validation report exists covering retrieval of parameters and metrics for multiple pipeline runs through the existing run surfaces, with a clear pass/fail conclusion per checked behavior.\n45\t- Parameters and metric values retrieved for a set of runs match the values shown on the corresponding per-run pages (no missing or misattributed values).\n46\t- Any gaps or limitations discovered are documented with severity and a recommended follow-up, and communicated to the Dashboard team.\n47\t\n48\t## HLR Traceability\n49\t\n50\t- HLR-1 (P0) / HLR-3 (P1) (supporting validation): the comparison view's correctness against Data Science Pipelines runs is confirmed by this epic; the comparison feature itself is built by the Dashboard team.\n51\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9c5fb85cbf9aabae","agent_id":"a96235dc186d39004","session_id":"000d175c-8257-4923-ab3f-0ba108064e97","uuid":"9c50ad44-0e4b-4349-b83d-4d9a171f483c","timestamp":"2026-10-25T18:52:45.266Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-bbe51dceea5345cb","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9015 decomposition"}
